cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Agent Passport System conformance corpus
message: Cite the exact commit you ran
type: dataset
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Agent-Authority-Conformance/aps-conformance-suite
url: https://github.com/Agent-Authority-Conformance

authors:
  - family-names: Pidlisnyi
    given-names: Tymofii

abstract: >-
  Versioned vectors, verifier adapters, external-system fixture families and
  attributed run records for agent-authority implementations, hosted by the
  Agent Authority Conformance lab. This repository is the initial corpus and
  targets Agent Passport System. The lab certifies nothing and issues no
  implementation-level or family-level conformance verdicts. A result cited from
  here is an observation at an exact commit, not a status.

